  m_Name: SeaSteamerDocks
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::BuildingDefinition
  id: SeaSteamerDocks
  displayName: Steamer Docks
  description: 'Brick warehouses, a coaling tower and steamships at the iron quay.
    Build one in two of your towns on the same water and merchant ships sail between
    them: coin and goods every voyage, more for long routes between big towns. Pirates
    prey on them; lighthouses and warships keep them safer. Each upgrade opens one
    more route.'
